## 附录 [可选]

### 附录 A：时间查询 Agent 核心代码示例

```python
# 基于 LangChain 的时间查询工具实现示例
from datetime import datetime
from pytz import timezone
from langchain.tools import Tool

def get_current_time(location: str = "北京") -> str:
    """获取指定城市当前时间"""
    now = datetime.now()
    
    # 时区映射
    tz_mapping = {
        "北京": timezone("Asia/Shanghai"),
        "纽约": timezone("America/New_York"),
        "伦敦": timezone("Europe/London"),
        "东京": timezone("Asia/Tokyo"),
    }
    
    tz = tz_mapping.get(location, timezone("Asia/Shanghai"))
    local_time = now.astimezone(tz)
    
    return local_time.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %Z")

time_tool = Tool(
    name="时间查询",
    func=get_current_time,
    description="获取指定城市当前时间，输入为城市名称"
)
```

